## 📊 Expected Result

After successful execution:

- The user receives Full Access permission
- The user can open the shared mailbox
- The user can read and manage mailbox contents
- AutoMapping remains disabled in the provided script
- Send As permission remains unchanged
- Send on Behalf permission remains unchanged

