## ⚠️ Important Notes

- Test the script with a small CSV file first
- Confirm that all email addresses are correct
- Keep the CSV column names unchanged
- Do not include empty rows in the CSV file
- Do not store passwords or credentials in the script
- Review all failed entries before running the script again
- Existing permissions may produce an error stating that the permission entry already exists
- Do not publish actual organizational email addresses in a public GitHub repository
- Full Access does not provide Send As or Send on Behalf permission

